---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="The story behind TORQLINE.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-gold">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl uppercase tracking-wide text-paper">TORQLINE</h1>
    <div class="mt-6 max-w-none space-y-4 text-muted">
      <p>
        TORQLINE started as a simple idea: car accessories should feel as
        deliberate as the car itself. Every part in our lineup — wheels,
        lighting, interior trim — is chosen or built to a standard we'd want
        on our own vehicles, not just what's cheapest to stock.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're a small, growing brand. Right now we're taking product
        inquiries directly by email while we build out the full lineup and
        an online checkout — get in touch and we'll get back to you
        personally.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
